{%- comment -%}
  Bandeau d'accueil vidéo (ISOMORPH, 17/09/2026)
  Vidéo de fond en lecture automatique muette et en boucle, titre en bas à gauche.
  - Affiche d'abord l'image de couverture, la vidéo n'est chargée qu'à l'entrée dans l'écran.
  - Bouton de pause obligatoire (RGAA 4.1, critère 13.8 : contenu en mouvement contrôlable).
  - Mouvement réduit demandé par le visiteur : la vidéo ne démarre pas, l'affiche reste.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign video = section.settings.video
  assign mobile_video = section.settings.mobile_video
  assign poster_image = section.settings.poster | default: video.preview_image

  comment
    Shopify n'expose au thème qu'un seul fichier mp4, celui de plus haute définition.
    Le script retient la définition la plus proche de la largeur de l'écran parmi
    celles qui sont disponibles, et s'abstient sur une connexion lente.
  endcomment

  assign liste_desktop = ''
  for source in video.sources
    if source.format == 'mp4'
      assign entree = '{"u":"' | append: source.url | append: '","w":' | append: source.width | append: '}'
      if liste_desktop == ''
        assign liste_desktop = entree
      else
        assign liste_desktop = liste_desktop | append: ',' | append: entree
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  assign sources_desktop = '[' | append: liste_desktop | append: ']'

  assign liste_mobile = ''
  for source in mobile_video.sources
    if source.format == 'mp4'
      assign entree = '{"u":"' | append: source.url | append: '","w":' | append: source.width | append: '}'
      if liste_mobile == ''
        assign liste_mobile = entree
      else
        assign liste_mobile = liste_mobile | append: ',' | append: entree
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  assign sources_mobile = '[' | append: liste_mobile | append: ']'
-%}
<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    --section-outer-spacing-block: 0;
    margin-block: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ section.settings.height_mobile }}svh;
    min-height: {{ section.settings.min_height_mobile }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.background }};
    isolation: isolate;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__media,
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__poster {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: {{ section.settings.focus_mobile }};
    display: block;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__media {
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity .6s ease;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv[data-playing='true'] .isohv__media {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgb({{ section.settings.scrim_color.rgb }} / {{ section.settings.scrim_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 0%,
      rgb({{ section.settings.scrim_color.rgb }} / {{ section.settings.scrim_opacity | times: 0.55 | divided_by: 100.0 }}) 28%,
      rgb({{ section.settings.scrim_color.rgb }} / 0) 62%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__inner {
    position: relative;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0 20px 28px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__title {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 100%;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ section.settings.title_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: {{ section.settings.title_weight }};
    line-height: {{ section.settings.title_line_height }};
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__pause {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-end: 20px;
    inset-inline-end: 20px;
    inline-size: 40px;
    block-size: 40px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / .45);
    color: #fff;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__pause:hover {
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / .65);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__pause:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #fff;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__pause svg {
    inline-size: 15px;
    block-size: 15px;
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__pause .isohv__icon--play {
    display: none;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv[data-playing='false'] .isohv__pause .isohv__icon--play {
    display: block;
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv[data-playing='false'] .isohv__pause .isohv__icon--pause {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 700px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv {
      height: {{ section.settings.height_desktop }}svh;
      min-height: {{ section.settings.min_height_desktop }}px;
      max-height: {{ section.settings.max_height_desktop }}px;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__media,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__poster {
      object-position: {{ section.settings.focus_desktop }};
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__inner {
      padding: 0 clamp(32px, 4vw, 64px) clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__title {
      font-size: {{ section.settings.title_size_desktop }}px;
      max-width: 40ch;
    }

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv__pause {
      inset-block-end: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
      inset-inline-end: clamp(32px, 4vw, 64px);
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="isohv" data-playing="false" data-sources-desktop="{{ sources_desktop | escape }}" data-sources-mobile="{{ sources_mobile | escape }}">
  {%- if poster_image != blank -%}
    {{ poster_image | image_url: width: 2200 | image_tag: class: 'isohv__poster', alt: '', sizes: '100vw', widths: '600,800,1000,1200,1600,2000,2200', fetchpriority: 'high' }}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if video != blank -%}
    <video class="isohv__media" playsinline muted loop preload="none" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></video>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="isohv__scrim"></div>

  <div class="isohv__inner">
    {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
      <{{ section.settings.heading_tag }} class="isohv__title">{{ section.settings.title | escape | newline_to_br }}</{{ section.settings.heading_tag }}>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- if video != blank -%}
    <button class="isohv__pause" type="button" hidden data-label-pause="{{ section.settings.label_pause | escape }}" data-label-play="{{ section.settings.label_play | escape }}" aria-label="{{ section.settings.label_pause | escape }}">
      <svg class="isohv__icon--pause" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 2h4v12H3zM9 2h4v12H9z"/></svg>
      <svg class="isohv__icon--play" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 2l10 6-10 6z"/></svg>
    </button>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.querySelector('#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .isohv');
    if (!root || root.dataset.ready === 'true') return;
    root.dataset.ready = 'true';

    var video = root.querySelector('.isohv__media');
    var button = root.querySelector('.isohv__pause');
    if (!video) return;

    var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    var petit = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 699px)').matches;
    var reseau = navigator.connection || {};
    var economie = reseau.saveData === true;
    // Connexion lente annoncee par le navigateur : l'affiche de couverture suffit.
    var reseau_lent = petit && reseau.effectiveType && reseau.effectiveType !== '4g';

    function lire_liste(valeur) {
      try { return JSON.parse(valeur || '[]'); } catch (e) { return []; }
    }

    function choisir(liste, largeur_max) {
      var tenables = liste.filter(function (s) { return s.w && s.w <= largeur_max; });
      var retenue = tenables.sort(function (a, b) { return b.w - a.w; })[0];
      return retenue ? retenue.u : '';
    }

    var liste_mobile = lire_liste(root.dataset.sourcesMobile);
    var liste_desktop = lire_liste(root.dataset.sourcesDesktop);
    if (!liste_mobile.length) liste_mobile = liste_desktop;

    var source = petit ? choisir(liste_mobile, 1920) : choisir(liste_desktop, 1920);

    function etat(joue) {
      root.dataset.playing = joue ? 'true' : 'false';
      if (button) button.setAttribute('aria-label', joue ? button.dataset.labelPause : button.dataset.labelPlay);
    }

    function charger() {
      if (video.dataset.loaded === 'true') return;
      video.dataset.loaded = 'true';
      video.src = source;
      video.load();
      video.play().then(function () { etat(true); }).catch(function () { etat(false); });
    }

    if (button) {
      button.hidden = false;
      button.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (video.paused) {
          charger();
          video.play().then(function () { etat(true); }).catch(function () {});
        } else {
          video.pause();
          etat(false);
        }
      });
    }

    video.addEventListener('playing', function () { etat(true); });
    video.addEventListener('pause', function () { etat(false); });

    if (reduced || economie || reseau_lent || !source) {
      etat(false);
      return;
    }

    if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
      var observateur = new IntersectionObserver(function (entrees) {
        entrees.forEach(function (entree) {
          if (entree.isIntersecting) {
            charger();
          } else if (video.dataset.loaded === 'true' && !video.paused) {
            video.pause();
          }
        });
      }, { rootMargin: '200px' });
      observateur.observe(root);
    } else {
      charger();
    }
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Bandeau d'accueil vidéo",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopify-section--iso-hero-video",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": [
      "header",
      "footer",
      "custom.overlay"
    ]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "video",
      "id": "video",
      "label": "Vidéo"
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "id": "mobile_video",
      "label": "Vidéo mobile",
      "info": "Facultatif. Sans vidéo mobile, la vidéo principale est utilisée."
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "poster",
      "label": "Image de couverture",
      "info": "Affichée avant le démarrage de la vidéo. Par défaut, la miniature de la vidéo."
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Titre"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Titre",
      "default": "O’CAOU, la solution à tous les \" au cas où . . . \" du quotidien",
      "info": "Un retour à la ligne dans ce champ force un retour à la ligne à l'écran."
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "heading_tag",
      "label": "Balise du titre",
      "default": "h1",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "h1",
          "label": "H1"
        },
        {
          "value": "h2",
          "label": "H2"
        },
        {
          "value": "p",
          "label": "Paragraphe"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "title_size_desktop",
      "label": "Taille sur ordinateur",
      "min": 24,
      "max": 72,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 44
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "title_size_mobile",
      "label": "Taille sur mobile",
      "min": 18,
      "max": 48,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 28
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "title_weight",
      "label": "Graisse",
      "min": 400,
      "max": 900,
      "step": 100,
      "default": 900
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title_line_height",
      "label": "Interligne",
      "default": "1.2"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "text_color",
      "label": "Couleur du titre",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Hauteur"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height_desktop",
      "label": "Hauteur sur ordinateur",
      "min": 40,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "min_height_desktop",
      "label": "Hauteur minimale sur ordinateur",
      "min": 320,
      "max": 720,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 480
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "max_height_desktop",
      "label": "Hauteur maximale sur ordinateur",
      "min": 480,
      "max": 1100,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 820
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height_mobile",
      "label": "Hauteur sur mobile",
      "min": 40,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "min_height_mobile",
      "label": "Hauteur minimale sur mobile",
      "min": 280,
      "max": 640,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 420
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "focus_desktop",
      "label": "Cadrage sur ordinateur",
      "default": "center center",
      "info": "Par exemple : center center, center top, 40% 60%."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "focus_mobile",
      "label": "Cadrage sur mobile",
      "default": "center center"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Lisibilité"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "scrim_color",
      "label": "Voile bas",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "scrim_opacity",
      "label": "Intensité du voile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 90,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "background",
      "label": "Fond avant chargement",
      "default": "#1c1c1c"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Accessibilité"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "label_pause",
      "label": "Libellé du bouton de pause",
      "default": "Mettre la vidéo en pause"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "label_play",
      "label": "Libellé du bouton de lecture",
      "default": "Lire la vidéo"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Bandeau d'accueil vidéo"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
